Kernel7702_Test
├── when initialize is called with packages
│   ├── it should not install any packages
│   └── it should not revert
├── when initialize is called multiple times
│   └── it should not revert on any call
├── when verifyFallbackSignature receives a valid ECDSA signature
│   └── it should return validation success
├── when verifyFallbackSignature receives an invalid ECDSA signature
│   └── it should return validation failed
├── when verifyFallbackSignature receives a malformed signature
│   └── it should return validation failed
├── when isValidSignature receives a valid raw ECDSA signature
│   └── it should return ERC1271_MAGICVALUE
├── when isValidSignature receives an invalid raw ECDSA signature
│   └── it should revert with InvalidValidationType error
├── when validateUserOp is called with root zero and valid ECDSA signature
│   └── it should return zero for validation success
├── when validateUserOp is called with root zero and wrong signer
│   └── it should return one for validation failure
└── when validateUserOp is called with root zero and malformed signature
    └── it should return one for validation failure
